---
// Location & SVG Route Map Component
---
<div class="bg-muted" id="kontak">
  <section class="section-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-subtitle">Lokasi & Kontak</span>
      <h2>Akses Mudah di Bobong</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Terletak strategis di pusat kota Bobong, dekat dengan fasilitas publik dan perkantoran.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-info-panel">
        <div class="info-block">
          <div class="info-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25s-7.5-4.108-7.5-11.25a7.5 7.5 0 1115 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="info-text">
            <h4>Alamat Utama</h4>
            <p>Bobong, Kec. Taliabu Barat, Kabupaten Pulau Taliabu, Maluku Utara.</p>
            <p class="text-hint text-muted">Akses jalan utama mudah dijangkau kendaraan roda dua maupun roda empat.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <div class="info-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="info-text">
            <h4>Pengelola / Narahubung</h4>
            <p><strong>Kak Ona:</strong> +62 813-5700-1357</p>
            <p class="text-hint text-muted">Hubungi via WhatsApp atau telepon langsung untuk survei unit kamar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Vector Route Map -->
      <div class="map-visual-card">
        <div class="map-header">
          <h4>Denah Panduan Lokasi</h4>
          <span>Pusat Kota Bobong</span>
        </div>
        <div class="map-body">
          <svg class="custom-route-map" viewBox="0 0 400 250" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="var(--bg-muted)" rx="8"/>
            <path d="M 50 180 Q 150 160 200 120 T 350 70" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M 200 120 L 200 40" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M 120 170 L 120 220" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M 50 180 Q 150 160 200 120 T 350 70" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary-light)" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="6,6"/>
            
            <circle cx="200" cy="40" r="10" fill="var(--primary)" />
            <circle cx="200" cy="40" r="4" fill="#ffffff" />
            <text x="220" y="45" fill="var(--text)" font-weight="700" font-size="13">Kos Fitrah</text>

            <rect x="35" y="165" width="30" height="30" rx="4" fill="var(--bg-card)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="75" y="185" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="600">Pelabuhan</text>

            <rect x="310" y="55" width="30" height="30" rx="4" fill="var(--bg-card)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="270" y="100" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="600">Pusat Pasar</text>
          </svg>
          <div class="map-notes">
            <span class="landmark-bullet"></span>
            <p>Hanya 5 menit dari Pelabuhan Bobong dan dekat pusat pemerintahan Pulau Taliabu.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
